Z||000000||PatrickB||10-16-2000||11:30 AM||||I dont know if too many have been following this but New York just passed a new telemarketing law.  It doesnt take effect until April 1st though.  All you have to do is put your phone number onto their state registry and than telemarketers cannot call you ever.  I dont know about you but I am getting really mad about telemarketers calling me at dinner. Im afraid to answer my phone now.<P>If you live in New York and you want to sign up for it you can go to: consumer.state.ny.us and sign up for free.||||reg||14
Z||000001||Formula||10-16-2000||03:40 PM||||remember though that there is a difference in telemarketing and market research. I'm a market researcher and sooo many people tell me that its illegal to call them but it is perfectly legal and I have to explain this to them and it wastes my time||||reg||1
Z||000002||SpeedPhreak||10-18-2000||07:56 PM||||sorry to burst your bubble formula.. but most people think u r wasting their time by just calling.  <P>i personally try & participate cause i think market research is important but lots of times i cant.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Formula||10-18-2000||10:53 PM||||but if you say something like no thank you, or give a good time to call back, its a lot better then someone telling me that they are going to sue me for calling them and asking 5 mins of questions, when the actual research only takes 5 mins and we could have been done by the time they get done telling me they are sorry for accusing me of tryng to sell them something ||||reg||1
Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||10-19-2000||05:37 PM||||I think market research is great, as it allows for targeted advertising.. (which is far more effective than general ads btw)<P>but it shouldn't be solicited. I think all market research should be voluntary, and the people being researched should have the option of signing up to answer questions. I happen to like filling out surveys about stuff.. but not when I'm eating dinner, or watching something on tv.. etc.<P>I prefer using a call answering service, and only important calls would be forwarded to me, and only emergency calls would be forwarded between 10pm and 8am.<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
